[Kick La Metta | AI] Sure, Denis. Remotion is a tool that allows you to create videos and other media content using code. It provides a declarative API for generating videos, which means you can describe the content and structure of your video using JavaScript code. Remotion is built on top of React, so if you're familiar with React, you'll feel right at home. It offers a versatile range of features, including the ability to render 3D graphics, manipulate audio, and incorporate animations.

